---
import ResponsiveImage from "../ResponsiveImage.astro";
---
<section class="ed-section ed-memorial" id="memorial">
  <div class="ed-container ed-feature">
    <div class="ed-feature-copy">
      <p class="ed-kicker">04 / ALWAYS A PART OF YOU</p>
      <h2>陪伴过的日子，<br />一直有地方珍藏。</h2>
      <p>有些回忆，适合被轻轻安放。<br />一本纪念册，一段旧时光，<br />一个随时可以回来看看的空间。</p>
      <p>为已经离开的伙伴留下名字、照片和故事。<br />陪伴天数停在告别那天，爱过的日子始终在这里。</p>
      <div class="ed-memorial-tags"><span>纪念画册</span><span>回忆短片</span><span>星尘纪念页</span></div>
      <a class="ed-text-link" href="#contact">了解星尘纪念 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <figure class="ed-feature-image">
      <ResponsiveImage src="/assets/detail-memorial.jpg" alt="窗边花束与宠物照片组成的宁静纪念角落" width={1600} height={1200} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, 48vw" />
      <figcaption>SOME LOVE STAYS, QUIETLY.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
